ip route add 192.168.124.0/24 via 192.168.123.200


Para averiguar el gateway para llegar a cierto punto en internet
================================================================
[jgarciavautrinraggi@pampero ~]$ ip route get 1.1.1.1
1.1.1.1 via 10.16.1.254 dev enp1s0 src 10.16.1.100 uid 63319
    cache


## SEGUNDA PREGUNTA:
El router que expone este servidor HTTP también expone un servidor DNS
======================================================================
 ¿Cuál es el SERIAL de www.google.com según este?

Para obtener la autoridad, hacemos la siguiente consulta
--------------------------------------------------------

root@ctf-lab-jgarciavautrinraggi:/# dig @192.168.123.200 www.google.com SOA

; <<>> DiG 9.18.39-0ubuntu0.24.04.8-Ubuntu <<>> @192.168.123.200 www.google.com SOA
; (1 server found)
;; global options: +cmd
;; Got answer:
;; ->>HEADER<<- opcode: QUERY, status: NOERROR, id: 31540
;; flags: qr aa rd; QUERY: 1, ANSWER: 2, AUTHORITY: 0, ADDITIONAL: 1
;; WARNING: recursion requested but not available

;; OPT PSEUDOSECTION:
; EDNS: version: 0, flags:; udp: 1232
; COOKIE: 6667521c00a905ca010000006aee4db939aae5480b8ea9b5 (good)
;; QUESTION SECTION:
;www.google.com.			IN	SOA

;; ANSWER SECTION:
www.google.com.		3600	IN	CNAME	google.com.
google.com.		604800	IN	SOA	ns.google.com. noveaslostxt.google.com. 74757169 69 420 666 69

;; Query time: 0 msec
;; SERVER: 192.168.123.200#53(192.168.123.200) (UDP)
;; WHEN: Fri Nov 06 21:59:21 UTC 2026
;; MSG SIZE  rcvd: 137


Nos dice "noveaslostxt.google.com" asique consultamos por txt:
--------------------------------------------------------------
root@ctf-lab-jgarciavautrinraggi:/# dig @192.168.123.200 www.google.com TXT

; <<>> DiG 9.18.39-0ubuntu0.24.04.8-Ubuntu <<>> @192.168.123.200 www.google.com TXT
; (1 server found)
;; global options: +cmd
;; Got answer:
;; ->>HEADER<<- opcode: QUERY, status: NOERROR, id: 14849
;; flags: qr aa rd; QUERY: 1, ANSWER: 3, AUTHORITY: 0, ADDITIONAL: 1
;; WARNING: recursion requested but not available

;; OPT PSEUDOSECTION:
; EDNS: version: 0, flags:; udp: 1232
; COOKIE: 440ff37d2acc31a8010000006aee4e80984159ed84f2b9ad (good)
;; QUESTION SECTION:
;www.google.com.			IN	TXT

;; ANSWER SECTION:
www.google.com.		3600	IN	CNAME	google.com.
google.com.		1	IN	TXT	"No pidas el TXT del subdominio 'easteregg'"
google.com.		1	IN	TXT	"El trabajo infantil no existe porque los menores no pueden legalmente trabajar"

;; Query time: 0 msec
;; SERVER: 192.168.123.200#53(192.168.123.200) (UDP)
;; WHEN: Fri Nov 06 22:02:40 UTC 2026
;; MSG SIZE  rcvd: 231


Para consultar un subdominio, hay que sacar el www
--------------------------------------------------

